    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract blocks, lines, tables, or layout elements from a document, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider that can perform this task. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to call the appropriate API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861042813,
          "start": 1789861040699
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc08123b001qOzCNJiES4ReMJ",
